flowchart TD
    Request["CLI or RPC request"] --> Inventory["Backend inventory or configured endpoints"]
    Inventory --> Validate["Validate requested core ID"]
    Validate --> Model{"GDB context model"}
    Model -->|Shared connection| Thread["Switch hardware thread and monitor target"]
    Model -->|Per-core endpoints| Inferior["Attach or reuse GDB inferior"]
    Thread --> Evidence["Collect backend and architecture identity evidence"]
    Inferior --> Evidence
    Evidence --> Verify{"Verify stable context identity"}
    Verify -->|Success| Result["Return CoreInfo / invalidate target caches"]
    Verify -->|Failure| Rollback["Restore previous context / explicit error"]
